{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203130","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1120313001:1":{"text":"이상하군. 혹시 이 아이가 최근에 누군가로부터 원한을 살 일이라도 했었나? 아니면 평소 사이가 안 좋은 사람이라도 있던가?","source_cn":"奇怪？这孩子最近有得罪过什么人吗？或者是有什么仇家之类的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFFFDD2BE2E62557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120313002:1":{"text":"없을… 걸요? 우르 부족은 다들 사이가 좋은데…","source_cn":"没有……吧？在我们乌尔氏族，大家相处的都挺好的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x585508D4325653E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120313003:1":{"text":"음… 그럼 혹시 요 근래 이상한 걸 먹은 적은 있고?","source_cn":"嗯……那她这几天有没有吃什么乱七八糟的东西？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FDBF94A709A598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120313004:1":{"text":"그건… 글쎄요. 아시잖아요, 아이들이 이상한 걸 집어먹는 일은 흔하니까요...","source_cn":"这个……我不太确定。你知道的，小孩子经常容易把奇怪的东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0BE5E0A6778EDB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120313005:1":{"text":"아, 그렇긴 하지. 미르키 녀석도 배가 고프면 뭐든 입에 다 쑤셔 넣긴 하니까. 못 먹게 하면 성질은 또 얼마나 내는지…","source_cn":"啊呀，说的也是，蒙蒙他们要是肚子饿了，什么都能往嘴里塞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFA3B179D1636EA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120313006:1":{"text":"크흠, 미안! 어쨌든 내 경험상 이 아이는 중독된 게 틀림없어.","source_cn":"咳，不好意思！总之根据我的经验来看，这孩子的症状应该都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x379E297EBEB168FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120313007:1":{"text":"중, 중독이요?! 역시 평범한 병이 아니었군요…","source_cn":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FCAF1A9536C1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1120313007":{"text":"중, 중독이요?! 역시 평범한 병이 아니었군요…","source_cn":"中、中毒？！果然不是普通的生病嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5FCAF1A9536C1CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120313008:1":{"text":"그건 아닌 것 같아. 우르 부족은 다른 부족과 꽤 멀리 떨어져 있어, 일부러 투약하러 오진 않을 거야.","source_cn":"看着不像，毕竟乌尔氏族远离其他氏族，应该不会是有人蓄意投毒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EFBB7B59612ED1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120313010:1":{"text":"그, 그럼 어떡하죠? 아이가 뭘 먹었는지 알아야 하나요? 하지만 시간이 오래 지났는데…","source_cn":"那、那我们该怎么办？找到她之前吃的东西吗？但是已经过去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA5E0407B64E5C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120313011:1":{"text":"걱정 붙들어 매래도. 내가 아는 독이야, 물론 해독 레시피도 알고 있고.","source_cn":"放心，她中的毒我见过，而且也知道解药配方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA0D49B004F8C777","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120313012:1":{"text":"자, 이 레시피대로 약초를 구해와.","source_cn":"喏，就是这个方子。你们只要按照方子上说的收集来草药就可以了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38F19A55CC5DBC0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120313013:1":{"text":"잠깐, 이 약초들은 다… 특히 발굽풀은…","source_cn":"等等，这些草药好像有点眼熟……兽蹄草……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DE834C49E8234D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120313014:1":{"text":"발굽풀은 이미 써봤어요! 하지만 전혀 소용이 없던데…","source_cn":"兽蹄草我之前都给她用过！但是完全没有奏效……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA494515C4E2704AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120313015:1":{"text":"…나만의 비법이 있다니까!","source_cn":"……我有独家秘方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E2397E2FD1A7892","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120313016:1":{"text":"하지만...","source_cn":"可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF675A5E894265F38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120313017:1":{"text":"일단 내가 적어 준 레시피대로 약초를 구해와!","source_cn":"你就别管这么多了，相信我就行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0EA824775ABAC965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120313018:1":{"text":"군가 축제 때 중독된 누가 구해줬는지 잊었어?","source_cn":"之前在战歌节上，你中的毒不也是我帮你解的嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x140561E30C6C7048","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120313019:1":{"text":"내 이름을 걸고 약속하지! 약초만 구해오면 아이를 구할 수 있다고!","source_cn":"我阿熏在这里给你打包票，只要你们能给我找来这些药材，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC32D04250B5AFF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120313020:0":{"text":"나는 아이를 돌보고 있을 테니 얼른 다녀와!","source_cn":"我先去照顾她了，你们快去快回！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B20C0FE3C33A5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120313021:0":{"text":"스모키가…","source_cn":"阿熏，他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57FAE73BBC1DD090","variant_status":"","male":""